{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02623","headline":"采药 · 王绩","name":"采药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野情贪药饵，郊居倦蓬荜。\n青龙护道符，白犬游仙术。\n腰鎌戊己月，负锸庚辛日。\n时时断嶂遮，往往孤峰出。\n行披葛仙经，坐检神农帙。\n龟蛇采二苓，赤白寻双术。\n地冻根难尽，藂枯苗易失。\n从容肉作名，薯蓣高成质。\n家丰松叶酒，器贮参花蜜。\n且复归去来，刀圭辅衰疾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}